	{
		"EXPANSION_RAMEN_NAME": "Risk of Ramen",
		"EXPANSION_RAMEN_DESC": "Adds content from the 'Risk of Ramen' mod into the game.",

		"ITEM_WAXIDOL_NAME": "Wax Idol",
		"ITEM_WAXIDOL_PICKUP": "Take less damage when you're ignited.",
		"ITEM_WAXIDOL_DESC": "Gain <style=cIsHealing>50</style> <style=cStack>(+10 per stack)</style> <style=cIsHealing>armor</style> when <style=cIsDamage>on fire</style>. Summon a <style=cIsUtility>Chud Wisp</style> to do <style=cIsHealing>nothing</style>.",
		"ITEM_WAXIDOL_DESC_OLD": "Gain <style=cIsHealing>50</style> <style=cStack>(+10 per stack)</style> <style=cIsHealing>armor</style> when <style=cIsDamage>on fire</style>. Recruit a <style=cIsUtility>friendly Wisp</style>.",
		"ITEM_WAXIDOL_LORE": "HELLO, LITTLE ONE.\n\n
OH?\n\n
YOU HAVE FOUND SOMETHING.\n\n
HAND IT TO ME, LITTLE ONE.\n\n
OH\n\n
A FASCINATING TALISMAN.\n\n
TAKE IT WITH YOU. IT WILL STRENGTHEN YOU, BRING YOU GOOD FORTUNE.\n\n
I AM PROUD OF YOU, LITTLE ONE.",

		"ITEM_OBSIDIANCARD_NAME": "Obsidian Card",
		"ITEM_OBSIDIANCARD_PICKUP": "Barrier decreases slower.",
		"ITEM_OBSIDIANCARD_DESC": "Your <style=cIsHealing>barrier</style> decreases <style=cisHealing>25%</style> <style=cStack>(+10% per stack)</style> slower.",
		"ITEM_OBSIDIANCARD_LORE": "<style=cMono>Lab Dissection Analysis File</style>\n\n
Subject: Obsidian Card\n
Technician: Ren Kellin\n
Table Spec: Mineral Analysis with Mass Spectrometer (see addendum)\n
Notes:\n\n
> Subject is a curved, thin piece of obsidian, about the size of a standard playing card\n
> Conchoidal fractures indicate the use of knapping techniques\n
> Inspecting surface with high powered microscope\n
> Very few visible impurities, even for obsidian\n
> MS analysis reveals an unusually even distribution of oxides typically found in obsidian aside from silica\n
> Despite this, fractures and structural irregularities suggest that the glass itself was indeed naturally formed\n
> Further samples requested, this is cool stuff\n\n

Addendum: Yes, Trapp, I know obsidian isn't a mineral, but we don't have a volcanic glass analysis table.",

                "ITEM_DENKUROPE_NAME": "Denku Rope Coil",
		"ITEM_DENKUROPE_PICKUP": "Your 'Critical Strikes' deal an additional 10% damage.",
		"ITEM_DENKUROPE_DESC": "<style=cIsDamage>Critical Strikes</style> deal an <style=cIsDamage>additional 10% damage</style> <style=cStack>(+10% per stack)</style>.",
		"ITEM_DENKUROPE_LORE": "<style=cMono>Lab Dissection Analysis File</style>\n\n
Subject: Denku Rope Coil\n
Technician: Ren Kellin\n
Table Spec: Manufactured Material with autoloom\n
Notes:\n\n

> Initial microscopy analysis of individual rope strands reveals the fibers are biological in origin, but very durable despite their apparent thinness\n
> Ends of the strands are cleanly cut at the micro scale, suggesting they were cut with a very sophisticated impleme\n
> I appear to be bleeding from a small laceration on my left index finger\n
> Pausing to disinfect and treat\n
> Resuming analysis\n
> Bandage lacerated from contact with the strand, closer examination and testing reveals that it cuts very easily when under tension\n
> Ending analysis, protective equipment needed for further testing",

		"ITEM_STAINEDBELT_NAME": "Stained Belt",
		"ITEM_STAINEDBELT_PICKUP": "Gain 'Critical Strike' chance when you have barrier.",
		"ITEM_STAINEDBELT_DESC": "Gain <style=cIsDamage>Critical Strike</style> chance equal to <style=cIsDamage>25%</style> <style=cStack>(+25% per stack)</style> of your <style=cIsHealing>barrier</style>.",
		"ITEM_STAINEDBELT_LORE": "A man limps into a quiet camp, covered in blood. He tosses his gun into the dirt, watching dispassionately as it bounces along the ground and clatters to a halt by a dying fire.\n\n
From a shadowy bench, a figure rises.\n\n
\"Oh my god, Henderson, you're alive!\"\n\n
\"Yeah.\"\n\n
\"How the hell did you get out of there? There must have been hundreds of them!\"\n\n
\"I... I dunno. I popped one in the head and... it was like my bullets were made of dynamite.\"\n\n
He wipes a chunk of meat off of his visor.\n\n
\"I think... I think I need to sit down.\"\n\n
As Henderson collapses onto the bench, he fiddles with something around his neck. It comes loose, dropping a small medallion into his hand.\n\n
\"Here.\"\n\n
\"What? I gave that to you to keep!\"\n\n
\"I don't care. If we had a shower, I wouldn't leave for two days. At least getting that thing off me gets a bit of the smell away.\"\n\n
The second figure sighs, and places the brooch in a pouch. As they retreat into a tent, Henderson stares down at his belt, soaked in blood and brains.",

		"WAXWISP_BODY_NAME": "Willow",

		"ITEM_GLASSTIARA_NAME": "Glass Tiara",
		"ITEM_GLASSTIARA_PICKUP": "Gain and lose max health when you earn and spend gold. <style=cIsVoid>Corrupts all Brittle Crowns.</style>",
		"ITEM_GLASSTIARA_DESC": "When you spend gold, temporarily <style=cIsHealth>reduce your max health</style> by 20% <style=cStack>(+5% per stack)</style> of spent gold. When you earn gold, <style=cIsHealing>increase your max health</style> by 10% <style=cStack>(+10% per stack)</style> of earned gold, capped at its normal value. <style=cIsVoid>Corrupts all Brittle Crowns.</style>",
		"ITEM_GLASSTIARA_LORE": "",

		"ITEM_ALLOCENTRISM_NAME": "Allocentrism",
		"ITEM_ALLOCENTRISM_PICKUP": "Hitting enemies gives them orbiting bombs. <style=cIsVoid>Every minute, subsume a non-Void item into Allocentrism.</style>",
		"ITEM_ALLOCENTRISM_DESC": "On hitting an enemy, that enemy gains an <style=cIsUtility>orbiting bomb</style> that detonates on other enemies for <style=cIsDamage>10% TOTAL damage</style>. You can have up to <style=cIsUtility>5 bombs</style> <style=cStack>(+1 per stack)</style> active at once. Every <style=cIsUtility>60</style> seconds, a random non-Void item is <style=cIsVoid>subsumed</style> by this item. <style=cIsVoid>Corrupts all Egocentrisms.</style>",
		"ITEM_ALLOCENTRISM_LORE": "...I can't hear anyone.\n\n
Everywhere I turn my gaze I see them. I've seen everyone.\n\n
Those that don't exist anymore. Those that won't exist for millenia.\n\n
Those that I've never met. Those that were family to me.\n\n
Those that look like me. Those that look like nothing of this reality.\n\n
They're talking.\n\n
Even the ones that don't have mouths.\n\n
I know they're talking. Why can't I hear them?\n\n
Can they hear me?\n\n
...No. I think not.",

		"ITEM_WORNTURNKEY_NAME": "Worn Turnkey",
		"ITEM_WORNTURNKEY_PICKUP": "Your stillness strengthens others.",
		"ITEM_WORNTURNKEY_DESC": "After standing still for <style=cIsUtility>1</style> second, <style=cIsUtility>ALL allies</style> recieve buffs to <style=cIsUtility>ALL stats</style>.",
		"ITEM_WORNTURNKEY_LORE": "<style=cMono>========================================\n
====   MyBabel Machine Translator   ====\n
====     [ Version 12.45.1.009 ]   ======\n
========================================\n
Training... <100000000 cycles>\n
Training... <100000000 cycles>\n
Training... <100000000 cycles>\n
Training... <74781455 cycles>\n
Paused...\n
Display partial result? Y/N\n
Y\n
================================\n\n</style>
\"Personal log of A.R. Kellin. My work is complete. 162 - 'Cinnamon', as I have taken to calling it - has finally [become]. The shell is complete, though inanimate.\"\n\n
\"I have fashioned a turnkey with which I may give it [stillness] and a charm by which it may know [purpose].\"\n\n
\"The turnkey slots into the back of its neck. I wind the key to the left twenty and one times. This one stirs, and its porcelain reflects the sun into my eyes.\"\n\n
\"Its eyes slide up to me and await something. I chuckle and nod.\"\n\n
\"It raises its arms and stretches out its entire body, brass ball-joints popping.\"\n\n
\"This one speaks. 'Good morning, [witch].'\"\n\n
<style=cMono>Translation Errors: 4</style>\n
